<title>SPAIN: Spain October budget deficit was 55.2 bln ptas.</title>
<headline>Spain October budget deficit was 55.2 bln ptas.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish Budget Secretary Jose Folgado said on Monday the October budget deficit was 55.2 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>This compares with a deficit of 193.4 billion pesetas in September.</p>
<p>A full breakdown of figures will be provided by the Economy Ministry later.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
